rooms_desc ({"This is Calico's little corner of the world. It looks very comfortable.There are pillows everywhere to lie on, and large pretty windowsto let the sun in. Calico likes to sit in them and watch the people.","This is Calico's library. Every wall is covered with bookshelves. Even the floor is taken up mostly by lines of more shelves. At the endsof some of them are chairs for people to sit in and relax whilethey browse through the books. You can see that some of Calico'sfavorites are fantasy and mystery. Sometimes you can catch Calico catnapping in one of the chairs. Shhhhhhhhhh.","This is Calico's stereo room. There are speakers in all four corners.ONLY the best brought to you by Bose. The entire west wall housesthe stereo system. It contains the best in stereo components.There is a huge white leather couch ensemble in the middle of the room.A glass coffee table sits in front of it, with the remote to the whole system sitting on it. There are decorative black metalCD towers scattered about the room. Calico likes to listen to all kindsof music, but right now some smooth rippin' jazz by the Rippingtonsis playing on the speakers. YEeeaahhhh.","This is another of Calico's libraries. The books, though, areall comic books. There is simply one good sized bench in themiddle of the room, next to a big table. The rest of the roomis filled with shelves of boxes. Most of them are empty, though.Looks like Calico has a long way to go on her collections.","The room is filled with nothing other than hundreds and hundreds of stuffed animals of every kind, shape and size!!!!!The sheer amount boggles the mind.","This is Calico's kitchen. It looks like a simple breakfast room.The table is big enough for a cozy meal with friends, and has aceramic top for easier cleanup when her rowdier friends get intofood fights. There are fresh flowers on the table and thecupboards are always full. Help yourself.","Calico seems to be full of surprises. There are several instrumentshere, thought you don't know if she can play them all. A grandpiano dominates the center of the room. In the southeast cornera cello sits against a chair small raised platform. Other instrumentshang from various shelves on the walls, but they don't look likethey are used much. The cello seems to be Calico's favorite.","Calico loves to go to the movies. This is a small theater with soft, plush theater seats and a big screen covering the south wall.The north wall is a huge window looking out on the garden atthe center of Calico's house. There are curtains to close over itwhen the movie starts. There's even a popcorn cart in thenortheast corner. It's show time.","This is a comfortable sitting room. The southeast corner isactually a curved bay window with a window seat. Thereare cushioned wicker chairs placed around a glass-toppedwicker table. It's a good place for a cup an conversation.","Calico has a strong taste for futons. There is a king sizefuton bed, covered with a beautiful hand-made quilt,against the east wall. A futon chair sits in the northwestcorner while a popason loveseat sits in the southwest corner.A simple lamp hangs above the futon chair, the only lightin the entire room. I guess she likes the lights low, hmmmmm?",})
rooms_short ({"Calico's Kitty Corner","Calico chases bookworms here","Calico's Cool-Cat Jazz Room","Super Calicooooooo!!!!! *heroic music in background*","Stuffed Animalmania","Calico's kitchen for craving cats","Calico's instrument room","Calico goes to the movies....coming soon to a theater near you","Calico's coffee cafe (actually she prefers rasberry tea)","Calico's catnaproom",})
