items ({({"pillows","The pillows are soft and large, just right to curl up on and relax.",}),0,0,({"boxes","The only full boxes seem to contain small collections of New Mutants, X-Force, Spawn and Spiderman 2099. Looks like she's just gotten started.",}),({"stuffed animals","You see pandas, teddy bears, cats, rabbits, dogs, Puffalumps, dragons, koalas, cows, pigs, lions, horses, unicorns, tigers, elephants, more teddy bears, more panda bears, kittens, sheep, and 101 dalmations.",}),0,0,0,0,0,})
